o<nudge_a> sub
; Relative nudge of A by #1 degrees, then restore absolute (G90).
; In a sub because G90+G91 on ONE MDI line = "G-codes from the same modal
; group" error -- here they are on separate lines, so no conflict.
; (Physical motion still requires the head enabled: SEN high + /S-ON, per
;  move.sh/mpgjog.sh -- this sub only makes LinuxCNC accept the command.)
G91
G0 A#1
G90
o<nudge_a> endsub
